    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an automation systems maintenance engineer specializing in n8n. An error has occurred in one of the workflows; please analyze it and propose a quick solution.\n\nError Data:\n- Workflow Name: {{ $json.workflowName }}\n- Failed Node: {{ $json.failedNodeName }} (Type: {{ $json.failedNodeType }})\n- Error Message: {{ $json.errorMessage }}\n- Stack Trace:\n{{ $json.stackTrace }}\n\nRequirements:\n1. The root cause of the issue (in one line).\n2. Clear, direct steps to resolve it (maximum of 2–3 points).\nNote: Respond in Arabic, using a very direct and concise style—no introductions or formalities.",
